blurry-b 2026-11-26: coin_b/coin_n/coin_q/coin_r.png re-traced to clean vector shapes (palette-quantised, potrace, re-rendered as a 512px transparent PNG at ~90%, hard anti-aliased edges, no fading; tool tools/sprite_vec.py) from the existing video crop, because no copy of the same image was found online (the blurred glow ring is now a solid ring).
blurry-b 2026-11-26: pawn, knight, rook, queen, joker, bot.png are the same Chess Survivors pixel sprites rebuilt from the blurred video crop: the art-pixel grid was measured, each cell sampled and palette-quantised, then scaled up nearest-neighbour to a 512px transparent PNG (tools/sprite_repix.py). No copy of the game sprites was found online.
bl-2 2026-11-26: bubble.png: redrawn as crisp pixel art (48-cell grid, nearest-neighbour to 480px on a 512px canvas) in the video sprite's colours: white rim, grey inner ring, translucent pink-white fill, two highlight pixels.
